# Quds Office Suite — Agent Operating Rules

You are implementing a two-package Office suite:

- `packages/quds_office_engine` — pure Dart. NEVER import `dart:ui` or Flutter.
- `packages/quds_office_editor` — Flutter RenderBox / LeafRenderObjectWidget only.

## Architecture

Follow the layout and Phase 1–6 roadmap in [docs/MISSION.md](docs/MISSION.md).
PDF-as-a-file is [docs/PDF.md](docs/PDF.md). Keep writer types (`PdfDocument`)
separate from `PdfFile`. Do not skip remaining honesty items in STANDARDS.
Do not leave `TODO` stubs or placeholder return values.
100% type safety: no `dynamic`, no untyped maps.

## Editor prohibition

Do not use TextField, TextFormField, EditableText, SelectableRegion,
SingleChildScrollView, ListView, or InteractiveViewer. All editing surfaces
are custom RenderBox subclasses.

## Current focus

Phase 6 PDF file has landed (`PdfFile`, `QudsPdfViewer`, `QudsPdfEditor`).
Do not rename the writer `PdfDocument`. Prefer Uint8List views, index slicing,
and object pooling over heap-heavy DOM trees. Honor STANDARDS limits
(CFF raster, JBIG2/JPX, CMS signature verify, certified PDF/A).
